      "user_id": 201,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769365597266666
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi Bob, I need to return some road cycling shoes I bought.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 73128,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769365601733332
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, I can certainly look into that for you. Do you have the order number handy?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 201,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769365605799998
