      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 73128,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769365611399998
    },
    {
      "text": "One moment... Okay, I see the order. You're looking to return the shoes?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 201,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769365617466664
    },
    {
      "text": "That's right. I'm hoping it's not too late.",
